WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:00.960
- I love going to games,

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.451
like for the mingling and the food.

00:00:02.451 --> 00:00:03.420
- Yes.
(Kelly chuckles)

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.253
Yes.

00:00:04.253 --> 00:00:05.580
- And the game.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.780
- [Mindy] You know what
my fear is about the food?

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:07.613
- In that order.

00:00:07.613 --> 00:00:09.900
- Is like, I'm so worried
that when the camera,

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.250
if you have good seats,

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.570
if the camera catches you

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.339
and you're just like eating a hamburger.

00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:15.172
- [Kelly] Mm-hmm.

00:00:15.172 --> 00:00:17.070
- And then, a player
falls on you or something.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.990
I just like, I just wanna seem dainty,

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.370
so I just like sip water or whatever.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.950
- I think just early on, like,

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.380
yeah, no, I've had like the
worst photos of me taken,

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.400
like in a bathing suit,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.860
like going down on like a big hot dog.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.720
Like, I've had the worst photos,

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.100
like, like a wave coming up.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.009
And I'm not like Heidi
Klum, it's just like...

00:00:34.009 --> 00:00:34.842
(Kelly groans)
(Mindy laughs)

00:00:34.842 --> 00:00:36.450
And it's like, you know, it's so comedic

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.010
that I just lean in and don't care.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.280
- I feel like most of my life
is avoiding becoming a meme.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:43.098
- I am 100, I don't care.

00:00:43.098 --> 00:00:43.931
(audience and Mindy laugh)

00:00:43.931 --> 00:00:45.358
Like, meme it up.

00:00:45.358 --> 00:00:47.610
Like, I don't care,
I'm gonna live my life,

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.110
I'm gonna have the hot dog.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.300
Did, did LeBron ever
notice you taking pictures?

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:52.480
Because you're really recognizable, so.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:56.430
- Yeah, so one time I
went to a game and he,

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.440
I was sitting next to people I didn't know

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:00.630
and he came down and
he waved and I assumed,

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:02.730
like clearly that he's
waving at somebody else.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:04.260
Like, why would he be waving at me?

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.120
And then I looked at the
two guys to see like,

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.290
who LeBron's friends were

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:08.430
and they were like, "We don't know him".

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:11.718
And I was like, "I think
LeBron was waving at me".

00:01:11.718 --> 00:01:12.551
(audience chuckles)

00:01:12.551 --> 00:01:15.000
Maybe he's a big, "The Mindy Project" fan.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:15.900
We never knew.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:16.733
- Wait...

00:01:16.733 --> 00:01:17.670
- [Mindy] Yeah, so he
gave me a little wave.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:18.840
- And you didn't wave back?

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:19.740
- No, because I didn't know it was me.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.660
So, now he probably thinks I'm unfriendly.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:22.950
- He thinks you're a snob.
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:24.929
- Because I big timed him.

00:01:24.929 --> 00:01:25.762
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:25.762 --> 00:01:26.970
So, now he'll know, because...

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:28.929
- [Kelly] Yeah, we're
gonna get this message out.

00:01:28.929 --> 00:01:29.850
(audience laughs)
- I just, you know...

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:31.860
- She would've waved,
LeBron, she would've waved.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.240
- I would've waved back,
I didn't wanna be...

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:34.739
You know, the worst feeling
is when someone waves

00:01:34.739 --> 00:01:35.760
and you're like, "Hey".

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:36.593
And they're like,

00:01:36.593 --> 00:01:38.460
"We don't care about you, it
was the person next to you".

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:39.750
I didn't wanna be that guy.

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.010
- Yeah, I've been that person a lot too.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:42.717
I feel like I'm a lot of
what you don't wanna be.

00:01:42.717 --> 00:01:44.350
- No, no.
(audience and Kelly laugh)

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:45.796
This is like...

00:01:45.796 --> 00:01:46.740
- You know what, you
should hang out with me.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.480
You would feel really good about yourself.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.640
I will cover the ground
of all the other things

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:51.543
and I won't care.

